      {
        "id": "convolution-definition",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "数学中的卷积定义",
        "moduleId": "convolution-vs-cross-correlation",
        "depth": "core",
        "markdown": "为什么把上面的操作称为卷积？数学中，两个函数 $f, g$（实数域上的函数）的卷积定义为：\n\n$$(f * g)(x) = ∫ f(z) g(x - z) dz$$\n\n也就是说，卷积在把一个函数翻转并平移 $x$ 时，测量它与另一个函数的重叠。离散情形下积分变为求和：$(f * g)(i) = Σ_{a} f(a) g(i - a)$；对二维张量则为 $(f * g)(i,j) = Σ_{a} Σ_{b} f(a,b) g(i - a, j - b)$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-567d03760c49273830ecff85",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000044"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "卷积神经网络",
                "从全连接层到卷积"
              ],
              "lineStart": 8890,
              "lineEnd": 9049,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0003/images/9b52b51b370b7ea3a76b5a1f190afc454bcd956366c6b2c61cf3bfca97601090.jpg",
